# Where does an average day go?
subtitle: "Split an average day into sleep, work, TV, meals and the rest, then compare your guess with a large American time-use survey."

## Where does an average day go?
use: bar_chart
with:
    labels:
      - Sleep
      - Work, school
      - TV
      - Meals
      - Other
    values:
      - 9
      - 3.8
      - 2.6
      - 1.2
      - 7.4
    ylim:
      - 0
      - 12
    value_labels: false
    y_label: Hours a day
    bar_colors: same
sources:
    - id: atus
      title: American Time Use Survey, 2025 results, Table 1
      authors: U.S. Bureau of Labor Statistics
      year: 2026
      url: https://www.bls.gov/news.release/atus.t01.htm
      finding: 'people aged 15 and over, averaged over all days: sleeping 9.03 h, working and work-related 3.32 h, education 0.44 h, watching TV 2.61 h, eating and drinking 1.21 h a day'

Where do a day's twenty-four hours go? Everyone gets the same twenty-four, and every one of them has to go somewhere.
    draw axes

    ask "How does the average day split? Drag each bar; the bar on the right shows the hours left." on all budget 24 judge false store d default 6,6,4,4,4 account_label "Hours left"
        right: You gave the most to {d.biggest}. Here is the split from a large American time-use survey.

    text h1 "9 h" x 200 y 560 font_size 30

Sleep takes the biggest share, about nine hours, and that is high because the survey counts everyone aged fifteen and over, on every day of the week.
    highlight bar_1

    text h2 "3.8 h" x 362 y 309 font_size 30

That is also why work and school look small: averaged over weekends, holidays and the retired, they come to under four hours.
    highlight bar_2

    text h3 "2.6 h" x 524 y 251 font_size 30

Television alone still takes over two and a half hours, and that is before phones and games are counted.
    highlight bar_3

    text h4 "1.2 h" x 686 y 183 font_size 30
    text h5 "7.4 h" x 848 y 483 font_size 30

Meals take a little over an hour. Everything else, from chores and shopping to travel and friends, fills the last seven hours or so.
    highlight bar_4 bar_5
---
